refused: d386_an_arena_says_room.cy:8:55, line 8 column 55
 8 |     let $arena: std::mem::arena = std::mem::arena.new(size: 1 mib, alloc: Lend $heap);
   |                                                       ^^^^
 fix:  `room`
 why:  an arena's own bookkeeping sits outside it, so `room:` is exactly the space for lists (D386)

